---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '') + '/';
---
<section class="adventure-hero" aria-labelledby="_top">
  <div class="hero-landscape" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 520" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice"><defs><linearGradient id="mist" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#437b61" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#437b61" stop-opacity=".24"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M0 340L126 240L240 307L410 185L550 320L690 220L805 330L900 235L1000 315V520H0Z" fill="url(#mist)"/><path d="M0 440L150 360L250 404L430 310L560 390L710 340L850 419L1000 332V520H0Z" fill="#24513e" opacity=".38"/><path d="M0 480Q260 405 520 477T1000 445V520H0Z" fill="#0b231c" opacity=".55"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-diamond" aria-hidden="true"></span> YOUR ADVENTURE, RECOMPILED</p>
    <h1 id="_top" data-page-title>A familiar world.<br /><em>A new way to play.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">Your field guide to Hookshot. Build Ocarina of Time for your PC, find your settings, and get back to exploring.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button-primary" href={`${base}guides/getting-started/`}>Begin your adventure <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="button-secondary" href={`${base}guides/common-issues/`}>Find an answer</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta"><span>WINDOWS & LINUX</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>COMMUNITY DOCUMENTATION</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="relic-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="relic-orbit orbit-two"></div>
    <span class="orbit-star star-one">✦</span><span class="orbit-star star-two">✧</span>
    <img src={`${base}assets/hookshot.png`} width="292" height="277" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
    <p>EVERY ADVENTURE<br /><span>starts with a little guidance.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>
